                                                                    <p class="sub-title">Robost construction for heavy-duty use</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div> -->
                                                            <p class="sub-title">1. Robost construction for heavy-duty
                                                                use
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p class="sub-title">2. Corrosion-resistant body</p>
                                                            <p class="sub-title">3. Tropicalised for high ambient
                                                                temperatures
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p class="sub-title">4. Twin-door larger capacity models to
                                                                avoid cooling loss
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p class="sub-title">5. Locks in all Models</p>
                                                            <p class="sub-title">6. High density PUF insulation for
